  "reading": {
    "zh": "跟随一个脚本穿过系统：前端完成词法与语法分析，策略与挂载/宿主层决定它能触及什么，标准库与运行时执行它，撤销记账让每处可撤销改动都能回滚，审计记录结果，触发器与 cron 安排后续运行，CLI 是用户的启动方式。",
    "en": "Follow a script through the system: the front end lexes and parses, the policy and mount/host layers decide what it may touch, the stdlib and runtime execute it, the undo module keeps every reversible change rollback-able, audit records the outcome, triggers and cron schedule further runs, and the CLI is how a user starts one."
  },
